# Map MAST target names to canonical HCNS names.
# Two columns, whitespace-separated: MAST_NAME  HCNS_NAME
# Both are case-insensitive (converted to uppercase internally).
# Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Example:
#   CENA-DW9    CENA-MM-DW9
